ns County","/arc-plc/minnesota/stevens-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids in Stevens County came in under 90% of normal in January to February in 39 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025 the middle ran 164% of normal in June to July. In 2026 it started at 37% in January to February. Grids 30735 and 31035 both had their driest year in 1976, at 37% of normal.</p>"}
